# sample_controls in a browser: the hidden button that enables the
# page's accessibility tree, found as a screen reader user finds it, by
# the reader's own move to the next button (NVDA's b in browse mode),
# then pressed; then the controls as on the desktop, the reader asked
# after each move what has the focus.
key b
key Return
wait 3
key Tab
focus
key Tab
focus
key space
key Tab
focus
key space
key Tab
focus
# Said by NVDA in Chrome as by the desktop readers.
expect Subtitles
expect checked
expect Sound
